3. THIRD-PARTY TRAINING DATA (NOT REDISTRIBUTED)
===========================================================================

This repository does not ship dataset audio. Users who train models must
obtain corpora separately and comply with upstream terms. Dataset licenses
are independent of both Apache-2.0 and the SoundEx Model Weights License.
SoundEx preprocessors use full-track mixtures only (no stems).

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
MUSDB18-HQ
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Summary:    Research-oriented terms as published by the MUSDB authors;
              commercial use and audio redistribution are restricted.
  Used as:    Clean full-track mixture only (mixture.wav).
  Weight impact: Any model trained with MUSDB18-HQ must be at least Tier C.
  More info:  https://sigsep.github.io/datasets/musdb.html
              https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3338373

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Slakh2100 / Slakh2100-redux
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Summary:    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
  Used as:    Clean full-track rendered mixture only (mix.flac / mix.wav).
  Weight impact: Slakh-only training may qualify for Tier A (with attribution).
  More info:  http://www.slakh.com/
              https://zenodo.org/records/4599666

  Attribution example:
    "This work uses the Slakh2100 dataset (Manilow et al.), CC BY 4.0."

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
MedleyDB / MedleyDB 2.0
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Summary:    Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike
              (CC BY-NC-SA). Non-commercial; share-alike for adaptations.
  Used as:    Clean full-track mix only (*_MIX.wav); STEMS/RAW ignored.
  Weight impact: MedleyDB in the BOM requires at least Tier B; if combined
              with MUSDB18-HQ, Tier C.
  More info:  https://medleydb.weebly.com/

  Attribution example:
    "This work uses MedleyDB (Bittner et al.), CC BY-NC-SA."

